AI Hand Gesture Computer Control System

Tagline

Control Your Computer with Hand Gestures

2. Introduction

The AI Hand Gesture Computer Control System is a computer-vision-based application that allows users to control basic computer functions using hand gestures.

The system uses a webcam to capture the user's hand movements. Computer vision and hand-landmark detection are used to identify different gestures. Each recognized gesture is mapped to a specific computer action such as moving the mouse, clicking, scrolling, or controlling volume.

This system provides a touch-free and interactive method of controlling a computer.

